8
00:00:22,798 --> 00:00:25,178
(Barry's Siri:)I'm sorry, Bawwy.

9
00:00:27,178 --> 00:00:30,598
l don't understand
"wecommend a westauwant."

10
00:00:35,519 --> 00:00:38,609
Listen to me.
Not restaurant. Restaurant.

11
00:00:40,608 --> 00:00:45,608
l don't know what you mean
by "Not westauwant. Westauwant."

12
00:00:45,863 --> 00:00:49,153
See? Total crap. You suck, Siri.

13
00:00:49,533 --> 00:00:52,283
(Raj:)Hey, don't talk to her like that.
She's a lady.

14
00:00:53,037 --> 00:00:57,877
